OL,3,GNEWSATractor driver denies causing
OL,4,Aman's quarry death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tractor driver has denied causing the
OL,7,Fdeath of another worker in the car park
OL,8,Fof a Lincolnshire quarry.
OL,10,FRobert Garfoot, 35, is accused of
OL,11,Fcausing the death of Craig Troop by
OL,12,Fcareless driving following the incident
OL,13,Fat Welton Aggregates, near Welton le
OL,14,FMarsh, on 11 November 2024.
OL,16,FGarfoot, of Charles Wright Court,
OL,17,FMablethorpe, pleaded not guilty when he
OL,18,Fappeared at Lincoln Crown Court on
OL,19,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
