OL,3,GNEWSATractor driver denies causing
OL,4,Aman's quarry death
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Simon Hirst adjourned the case
OL,7,Ffor a trial, which is expected to last
OL,8,Ffour days, at Lincoln Crown Court on 24
OL,9,FMay next year. He was granted bail
OL,10,Funtil his next court appearance.
